Given the code below, which line will cause a compile-time error?

public class Test {
    static void staticMethod() {}
    void instanceMethod() {}
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        staticMethod(); // 1
        Test.staticMethod(); // 2
        instanceMethod(); // 3
        Test obj = new Test();
        obj.instanceMethod(); // 4
    }
}

